                    "faIcon": "",
                    "faIconColors": {
                        "bg": "",
                        "fill": ""
                    },
                    "locales": {
                        "en": {
                            "text": "<p>A seasoned {{Esri}} certified professional with [[over a decade]] of expertise in GIS, software development, and teaching, I currently serve as a Senior Solutions and Product Analyst at {{Esri Lebanon}}.</p><p>I hold a Bachelor's degree in Surveying Engineering and Master's degrees in Computer Science, GIS, and Data Science. My diverse educational background and extensive industry experience position me as a recognized expert in delivering [[innovative geospatial solutions]].</p><p>At Esri Lebanon, I leverage my skills to analyze and develop tailored solutions that address complex client requirements, ensuring [[excellence and client satisfaction]].</p>"
                        }
                    }
                }
            ]
